# Copy to deploy/authenticated-emails.txt and list the Google account(s)
# allowed to sign in, one email per line. This is the actual access-control
# decision -- oauth2-proxy lets anyone *authenticate* to Google, but only
# emails listed here are let through afterward. deploy/authenticated-emails.txt
# is gitignored (see .gitignore) -- it's a real allowlist, not a template.
your-email@gmail.com
